<p>Not an official crit but I’ll give it a go!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>21st tech-savvy catfishing sirens isn’t something I knew I wanted til now, the idea definitely gave me a good chuckle. Though I do have to ask how exactly do the sirens have the paratech? Did they make it themselves, did they buy it or some other way of obtaining it? And are the ads targeting people who specifically would click on an ad like that (like people with a mermaid fetish)?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>I think your idea does have legs (unlike the sirens), and happy to see where it goes.</p>

							</div>

								
					
